Z||000002||rogergarrison||08-07-2001||12:27 AM||||I had a Mercedes 450 SL series roadster. It was also AMG. I loved that car, had like 250,000 miles on it when I sold it to build my Fiero/Ferrari. Yes there fast, would still kick down into passing gear (they only made autos) at almost 100 mph. They handle well, but my Fiero still is better on curves. The Mercedes was a lot more sure footed at speed, but im sure at 3800 pnds, weight had a lot to do with that.||||reg||1
