Z||000006||artherd||08-07-2001||04:42 AM||||LOVE one aspect of this car, the nearly all glass roof with the super sexy curves as seen from above.<P>Too bad it's just an ugly hatchback from most viewpoints.  Not identifiable as a Benz at all, I've seen plenty in person already, and they really look like hondas.<P>"Sport Coupe" well, it's not very sporty, actually.  heavier and slower than the C it's based on.  But hey. It's all in the marketing.  "Hatchback C" wouldn't sell too many in the 'states, would it?<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/88ttop.jpg">  <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top Metalic Red<BR>88 Formula, Silver<BR>87 Coupe, Metalic Red<BR>"Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>                -Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"||||reg||1
